<title>CHINA: Shanghai Goods '96 net up 14.88 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Goods '96 net up 14.88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	   715.527	 vs	943.235</p>
<p> Net profit	  11.035	 vs	  9.606</p>
<p> Asset per share    1.781 yuan  vs	  1.724 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share 0.053 yuan  vs	  0.046 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Goods and Materials Trade Centre Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results were released by a company statement on Wednesday. All figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors have proposed a one-for-10 bonus issue based on its capital reserves pending approval at a shareholders meeting, the company statement said.</p>
</text>
